This mod is a community continuation of three Project Zomboid mods, all discontinued
by their original author and released under the MIT License:

- "Equipment UI" by Notloc
  https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2950902979

- "Reorder The Hotbar" by Notloc
  https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2903771337

- "Reorder Containers - Backpack Orders" by Notloc
  https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2901962885

Original notice from the author: "Mod is MIT licensed. No further support will be
provided."

